            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_SUPPLY_POOL">
                <English>%1 (your side's force pool)</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_DEPLOYED">
                <English>%1 deployed.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_DISMANTLED">
                <English>%1 dismantled. Its FOB kit is back.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_DISMANTLED_SUPPLY">
                <English>%1 dismantled. Its FOB kit is back, with %2 supply in a crate.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_SIDE">
                <English>Only BLUFOR, OPFOR and Independent players can deploy a FOB.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_KIT">
                <English>That isn't a FOB kit for your side, or you're too far from it.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_WATER">
                <English>A FOB can't be deployed in water.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_CAP">
                <English>Your side already has as many FOBs as it may (%1). Take and hold more objectives, or dismantle one.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_SLOPE">
                <English>The ground is too steep here. Find somewhere flatter.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_DISTANCE">
                <English>Too close to another FOB. FOBs must be at least %1 m apart.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_SPOT">
                <English>The FOB couldn't be built here.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_NOTOURS">
                <English>That FOB isn't your side's.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_RANGE">
                <English>Get within %1 m of the FOB first.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_REFUSED_DAMAGED">
                <English>A damaged FOB can't be dismantled until it's repaired.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ACTION_BUILD">
                <English>Build Menu</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ACTION_RECYCLE">
                <English>Recycle (half its price back)</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ACTION_PLACE">
                <English>Place %1 (%2 supply)</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ACTION_ROTATE">
                <English>Rotate 45 degrees</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ACTION_CANCEL">
                <English>Cancel placing</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_PLACE_HELP">
                <English>Walk and turn to move it. Green: it can go here. Red: it can't.&lt;br/&gt;Place, Rotate and Cancel are on the scroll menu.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_PLACE_LEFT">
                <English>You left the FOB's build range, so placing stopped.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_PLACE_BAD">
                <English>It can't go here: keep it inside the FOB's build range and out of water.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_UI_SEARCH">
                <English>Search</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_UI_SEARCH_TIP">
                <English>Type part of a name to show only the items that match, in the category you have open.</English>
            </Key>
