                <English>Resupply Threshold (%)</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_RESUPPLY_THRESHOLD_COMMENT">
                <English>In FOB Supply mode, a FOB below this share of its supply limit asks its side's Military Logistics for a supply truck, at most every 10 minutes. The truck brings a Supply Crate's worth. 0 turns it off. Needs a Military Logistics module for that side.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ENEMY_TARGETING">
                <English>Enemy Targeting</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_ENEMY_TARGETING_COMMENT">
                <English>Whether enemy AI Commanders go after FOBs. Contact: once their men have found it (came within the Discovery Radius or shot at its headquarters). Immediate: from the moment it is deployed. Off: never. Insurgent commanders go after a FOB too; a strong garrison draws attacks rather than an assault.</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_TARGETING_CONTACT">
                <English>Contact</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_TARGETING_IMMEDIATE">
