            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_GARRISON_COST">
                <English>Garrison Cost</English>
            </Key>
            <Key ID="STR_ALIVE_FOB_GARRISON_COST_COMMENT">
                <English>A tier 2 or 3 FOB keeps a garrison of one infantry group of its faction, which holds the FOB and is never sent elsewhere. Each new garrison costs this much of the FOB's supply; when the last of it is killed, the next one is paid for again.</English>
            </Key>
